1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,140
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She hears a meow.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,140
It is coming from a tree.

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,320
She looks closely at the tree.

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,600
She sees a cute white cat.

5
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,660
It is stuck.

6
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,680
She climbs up the tree.

7
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,940
She brings the cat down.

8
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:24,480
The cat's owner is happy.

9
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:28,180
The cat's owner gives her $15.

10
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:32,860
She buys her own cat with the money.
